hey, this is a real linux vm running in your browser :)

feel free to explore, nerds.

  ls           - list files
  cat <file>   - read a file
  cd projects  - check out some of my projects
  uname -a     - kernel info
  whoami       - you know who

  cat /etc/sources.txt   - credits & sources

